flowchart TB
  subgraph Discovery[Coach discovery without an AI dependency]
    Query[Search sentence or saved preferences]
    Parse[Local aliases, typo tolerance and intent parsing]
    Filter[Sport, city, level, format, budget, day and goals]
    Rank[Deterministic weighted scoring]
    Reasons[Editable filters and visible match reasons]
    Catalog[Complete approved and clearly labeled demo catalog]

    Query --> Parse --> Filter --> Rank --> Reasons --> Catalog
  end

  subgraph TrainingPlans[Optional private training-plan generation]
    Form[Validated sport, level, goals and schedule]
    Gemini[Server-only Gemini request]
    Validate[Validate structured four-week output]
    Fallback[Built-in deterministic fallback]
    PrivatePlan[(Private member training plan)]

    Form --> Gemini --> Validate --> PrivatePlan
    Gemini -. timeout or invalid output .-> Fallback --> PrivatePlan
  end

  Boundary[AI cannot approve coaches, change permissions, rank the catalog, book sessions, process payments or access passwords]
  Boundary -. enforced product boundary .-> Gemini
